# CardDemo backend configuration.
#
# This file is committed so the team shares one working setup: clone, run, done. It holds live
# credentials for the shared demonstration database, so it is only appropriate while this
# repository stays private and the data stays non-production.
#
# Before this application carries anything real: rotate both values, delete this file, and go back
# to supplying them from the environment or the deployment's secret store. .env.example documents
# the keys for that.
#
# run-backend.ps1 loads this into the process environment. Anything already exported wins, so you
# can override a value for one session without editing the file.

DB_PASSWORD=bv3a2p3juclcYgd2

# Session-token signing key. Changing it invalidates every token already issued, which just means
# everyone signs on again.
CARDDEMO_JWT_SECRET=gCvGO3YBBxVZEErcU8la9srzEYy2gscLRYEURn5jUr98yld3leKyUYv9IY8zRUzx
